    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HexON</strong> is a relaxing puzzle game where you connect magnetic pieces to a hexagonal board.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In each level you have a different board and set of pieces. You need to plug all pieces to the board to complete each level.  No piece can be left unplugged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40 hand-crafted levels; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack to help you relax while solving the puzzles; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game for everyone who likes jigsaw puzzles and gridlock games.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you find out the exact configuration that will complete the board?</strong></p>",
